# =============================================================================
# Mosquitto topic ACL.
#
# Least-privilege per user. Default-deny: anything not explicitly allowed
# below is silently denied by Mosquitto.
#
# Clients / roles:
#   sim_user    = the Python sensor simulator (one role per physical device
#                 in a real deployment; here exactly one synthetic device).
#                 May only PUBLISH telemetry on its assigned room topic —
#                 never subscribe (prevents a compromised simulator from
#                 eavesdropping on its own or others' streams).
#   ingest_user = the MQTT->SQLite ingestion service. May only SUBSCRIBE
#                 to the assigned room topic — never publish (prevents a
#                 compromised ingestion from spoofing sensor data back onto
#                 the bus).
#
# Topic pattern matches the Config.MQTT_TOPIC_TEMPLATE used by the
# simulator. A future multi-room rollout would add lines like:
#       topic write home/room2/telemetry
#       topic read  home/room2/telemetry
# =============================================================================

user sim_user
topic write home/room1/telemetry

user ingest_user
topic read home/room1/telemetry
